    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Brain and Mind Institute carried out a series of community and health system engagement activities in Kilifi County from August 25-29, 2025, as part of the Africa FINGERS program. Supported by the UK's Medical Research Council (MRC) and the FINGERS Brain Health Institute, the initiative seeks to adapt proven dementia prevention strategies to African realities and promote healthier aging.",
